WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.969
JUST TO SHOW HOW
EXCITED PEOPLE GOT, SHOW YOU

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:07.073
THIS LITTLE MOMENT FROM EARLIER
ON.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.275
AS KING CHARLES WAS GOING ALONG
THE CROWDS.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.680
I THINK PEOPLE.
QUITE OVERCOME WITH EMOTION, AND

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.449
THEY WERE SORT OF LEANING
FORWARD TO HIM, AND THEN LOOK AT

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:24.624
THIS.
WAIT FOR THIS.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:28.561
NOW THAT WAS JUST A FEW MINUTES
AGO.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.197
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AND OUR PRODUCER

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:34.868
WENT ON AN INTREPID SEARCH TO
FIND THE PERPETRATOR OF THAT

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:42.609
KISS AND YOUR NAME IS JEGENEJEN.
WHAT WENT THROUGH YOUR MIND WHEN

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.944
YOU SAW THE KING?
&gt;&gt; I COULDN'T BELIEVE IT AND I

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:48.548
SAID, MAY I KISS YOU?
YES.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:52.352
SO I GRABBED HIM, AND I'M VERY
HAPPY, VERY, VERY MUCH.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.954
THANK YOU FOR LETTING ME SEE HIM
AND KISS HIM.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.356
&gt;&gt; Reporter: HOW DID YOU FEEL
WHEN YOU SAW HIM?

00:00:56.356 --> 00:01:02.896
WHY DID YOU WANT TO DO THAT?
&gt;&gt; I LOVE THE ROYAL FAMILY.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:09.969
ALWAYS I'M WATCHING THEM, BY THE
VENEER, FROM SMALL BABY TO

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:11.871
GROWING UP.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: DID YOU EVER THINK

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.240
YOU'D KISS A KING ON THE LIPS?
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.842
NO!
NEVER CROSSED MY MIND.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:18.745
&gt;&gt; Reporter: HE LOOKED RELAXED.
DIDN'T HE?

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.146
CONSIDERING WHAT HE'S BEEN
THROUGH?

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.950
&gt;&gt; YES.
HE LOOKED SAD.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:28.221
LOOKED SAD.
I SAY, MAY I KISS YOU, AND HE

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.455
SAID, YEAH.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: AND WHY ARE YOU

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:30.990
DOING THAT?
COMFORT HIM?

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.359
REASSURE HIM OR JUST A FEELING
THAT OVERCAME YOU?

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:36.129
&gt;&gt; YES.
JUST A FEELING, ACTUALLY.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.299
OH, MY GOD.
IN THE FRONT, YES.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.501
&gt;&gt; Reporter: VERY HEARTENING FOR
HIM TO SEE THE REACTION FROM THE

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.969
CROWDS THERE.
THE WARMTH.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.638
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: DID YOU GET A SENSE

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:49.776
IT WAS COMFORTING FOR HIM?
&gt;&gt; I THINK SO, YEAH, BECAUSE HE

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:54.047
WAS -- SMILING.
HE DIDN'T SAY LIKE -- LOVELY AND

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:57.050
STARTED SMILING.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SHOWS HE'S NOT AT

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.386
UP TIGHT AS PEOPLE EXPECT A KING
TO BE.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.188
NOT AS NERVOUS.
HE'S NOT AT --

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:04.023
&gt;&gt; NO, NO.
HE'S PERFECT.

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.291
&gt;&gt; Reporter: HOW WOULD YOU
DESCRIBE HIM?

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.527
&gt;&gt; LOVELY.
HE'S PERFECT.

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:13.066
I'M ALWAYS LIKING HIM.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WHERE ARE YOU FROM?

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:23.376
&gt;&gt; I COME FROM SIDE AND FROM
GREECE.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:24.877
&gt;&gt; Reporter: PRINCE OF GREECE.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:26.613
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YOU FEEL LIKE
KINSHIP?

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.880
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WHAT WAS THE

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.016
ATMOSPHERE LIKE OUT THERE
AMONGST THE CROWDS?

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:33.052
&gt;&gt; IT'S OKAY.
EVERYBODY HAPPY.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:39.192
YEAH.
EVERYBODY --

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:42.362
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JENNY, YOU'RE GOING
VIRAL AS WE SPEAK.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:47.667
&gt;&gt; AND THE OTHER DAY, IT JUST --
CALLED FAMILY.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.402
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YOUR SON, WHAT DID
HE SAY?

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.238
&gt;&gt; HE SAID, I'M BUSY NOW.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THERE'S A STORY TO

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:54.340
TELL THE REST OF THE FAMILY.
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.609
I'M VERY HAPPY.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: JENNY VIDEO NOW

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:57.977
WORLD FAMOUS.
BACK TO YOU GUYS.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:01.514
&gt;&gt; I'LL TELL YOU, AS JOURNALISTS
THERE ARE TIMES YOU'RE LUCKY

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.117
ENOUGH TO WITNESS HISTORIC,
MEMORABLE MOMENTS, IN THE

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.252
MOMENT, AND I THINK THAT WAS
JUST ONE OF THEM.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.355
CERTAINLY THE BIGGER PICTURE.
THE NEW KING GREETING THE CROWD,

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:13.026
BUT I THINK WE'LL TALK ABOUT
THAT --

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.594
&gt;&gt; THE KISS FOR THE HISTORY
BOOKS.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:19.899
&gt;&gt; JENNY'S KISS SEEN AROUND THE
WORLD.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:25.738
AND CNN MATTHEW CHANCE ALSO IN
LONDON.

00:03:25.738 --> 00:03:27.940
DOWN DO
DOWNTOWN LONDON.

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.176
JUST DOWN THE STREET FROM
BUCKINGHAM PALACE.

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:31.678
WHAT ARE YOU HEARING FROM THE
PEOPLE?

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.079
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YEAH THAT'S RIGHT,
JIM.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:37.050
IN FACT, YOU CAN SEE BUCKINGHAM
PALACE IN THE DISTANCE BEHIND

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.986
ME.
THIS IS THE SORT OF RED PAVED

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:42.955
AVENUE WHICH LEADS RIGHT UP TO
THAT MAIN ROYAL RESIDENCE UP

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:45.491
THERE, AND YOU CAN SEE.
THERE ARE LOTS OF PEOPLE.

00:03:45.491 --> 00:03:47.994
THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE, THAT ARE
TAKING SOME TIME OUT OF THEIR

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:51.264
DAY TO GO TOWARDS THE GATES OF
BUCKINGHAM PALACE WHERE THEY

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:55.434
CAN, YOU KNOW, ACTUALLY THERE TO
MEET KING CHARLES III, AS WE'VE

00:03:55.434 --> 00:04:00.106
JUST SEEN SOME OF THEM DOING,
BUT ALSO TO PAY THEIR RESPECTS

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.341
TO QUEEN ELIZABETH II, OF
COURSE, WHO PASSED AWAY

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:07.613
YESTERDAY.
IT'S INTERESTING FOR ME, BECAUSE

00:04:07.613 --> 00:04:09.582
I'VE BEEN TALKING TO A LOT OF
PEOPLE THROUGHOUT THE COURSE OF

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:12.985
THIS MORNING, AND I HAVE TO SAY.
THERE'S A LITTLE BIT OF DIVISION

00:04:12.985 --> 00:04:16.789
BETWEEN THE LEVEL OF SADNESS
THAT PEOPLE ARE EXPRESSING.

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:19.125
I MEAN, THERE'S A GENERAL SADS
IN, OF COURSE.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:24.831
PEOPLE ARE VERY AFFECTIONIST
TOWARDS QUEEN ELIZABETH AND SAD

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:30.169
TO SEE HER GO, BUT WHEN YOU
SPEAK TO THE OLDER PEOPLE, OLDER

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:34.040
GENERATIONS HERE, THEY'RE VERY
MUCH REMINDED THIS IS A PERSON

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:38.010
VERY MUCH ICONIC, WITH THEM MOST
OF THEIR LIVES, ALL OF THEIR

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.314
LIVES IN MANY CASES AND HAVE
KNOWN NO ONE ELSE.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:45.418
SO THE QUEEN OCCUPIED THIS
INCREDIBLY ICONIC AND UNIQUE

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:49.689
POSITION IN BRITISH SOCIETY.
THE YOUNGER GENERATION OF, YOU

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:52.525
KNOW, GENERAL, UNSCIENTIFIC
STRAW POLL, ALSO HAD AFFECTION

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:57.263
TOWARDS THE QUEEN, BUT OBVIOUSLY
SHE'S NOT PLAYED QUITE AS BIG A

00:04:57.263 --> 00:05:01.234
ROLE IN THEIR LIVES AS, YOU
KNOW, THE PEOPLE IN THEIR 60s,

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:04.604
70s AND 80s.
SO I THINK THERE'S A DIMINISHING

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:09.742
AMOUNT OF, YOU KNOW, SENSE THAT
SHE EMBODIES THE PEOPLE, AND,

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:13.179
YOU KNOW, BUT I THINK WHAT'S
INTERESTING IS THAT EVEN THOUGH

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:19.952
THE ACCESSION OF THE THRONE HAS
BEEN AUTOMATIC, FROM ELIZABETH

00:05:19.952 --> 00:05:24.824
TO CHARLES, THE TRANSMISSION OF
THE AUTHORITY AND OF THE RESPECT

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.326
THE QUEEN HAS ISN'T NECESSARILY
AUTOMATIC.

00:05:27.326 --> 00:05:30.496
SO THAT'S WHY IT WAS SO
IMPORTANT SEEKING KING CHARLES

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.965
III OUT TODAY RECEIVING A VERY
WARM WELCOME FROM CROWDS.

